WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.005
The sky's been doing that all morning. A chip company just made 133 trillion won in a quarter — up 106 percent. They're calling it storm growth.

00:00:10.005 --> 00:00:18.005
I can infer that. The storm doesn't fall on the seller. It falls on the renters.

00:00:18.005 --> 00:00:23.018
Deploy more agents! If it's a storm, you ride it!

00:00:23.018 --> 00:00:30.036
Wait… those white robots spinning inside the storm — those are ours, aren't they?

00:00:30.036 --> 00:00:39.038
Great growth! Revenue up 106 percent, so your rent is up 106 percent too. Ride the storm!

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:45.054
My calculator! A 133-trillion typhoon takes the calculator too!

00:00:45.054 --> 00:00:53.054
Oh. This typhoon is ours. We deployed more agents to save money.

00:00:53.054 --> 00:01:02.056
So from today, inference runs on our own servers. Somebody else's typhoon is just TV weather.

00:01:02.056 --> 00:01:09.074
…the typhoon just popped. And a single card fell out of it. That one's ours.

